lass=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Items\">Items</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"item-animation\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"\">Notes</th></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Adventurer%20Backpack\">Adventurer Backpack</a></td><td class=\"item-animation\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Adventurer Backpack\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Adventurer_Backpack_679ae7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td>Obtainable by completing the quest A long lost treasure through the <a href=\"#/quest/targuna-quest\">Targuna Quest</a>.\nSee Backpacks for general information regarding backpacks.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Bunch%20of%20Turnips\">Bunch of Turnips</a></td><td class=\"item-animation\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bunch of Turnips\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bunch_of_Turnips_09d878.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td>Item needed to tame a <a href=\"#/wiki/Reliable%20Ram\">Reliable Ram</a>.\nIt's a reward of the <a href=\"#/quest/targuna-quest\">Targuna Quest</a>.</td></tr><tr><td>Charred Mask</td><td class=\"item-animation\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Charred Mask\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Charred_Mask_edb976.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Gold Tooth</td><td class=\"item-animation\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Gold Tooth\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Tooth_177ec1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td>This item is used in Delivery Tasks. It is highly recommended to sell it to other players, as its market value is higher than the NPC sell price.</td></tr><tr><td>Infernoid Ember</td><td class=\"item-animation\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Infernoid Ember\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Infernoid_Ember_5f8eaa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Lizard Tail</td><td class=\"item-animation\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Lizard Tail\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lizard_Tail_b7b59c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Old%20Treasure%20Map\">Old Treasure Map</a></td><td class=\"item-animation\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Old Treasure Map\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Old_Treasure_Map_07e4f2.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td>Received from <a href=\"#/wiki/Morla\">Morla</a> bring it to <a href=\"#/wiki/Sterling\">Sterling</a> to advance in getting the <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Adventurer%20Backpack\"><img alt=\"Adventurer Backpack\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Adventurer_Backpack_679ae7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Adventurer%20Backpack\">Adventurer Backpack</a>.</td></tr><tr><td>Sailor's Burn Cure</td><td class=\"item-animation\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Sailor's Burn Cure\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sailor_s_Burn_Cure_79ed0e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td>Using the Sailor's Burn Cure will cure the user of the Special Condition called <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Burning\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Burning_Icon_6a9d24.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Burning, acting just as the spell Cure Burning.</td></tr><tr><td>Sail Pass</td><td class=\"item-animation\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Sail Pass\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sail_Pass_12c932.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["newhaven-quest","targuna-quest"]}